oute must compile public/cloud-crush.wasm, copy source assets into public/assets, and use the matching Go wasm_exec.js; the current public asset directory is incomplete. Cloud deployment is optional. The creator’s generation claim is distinct from independent code-authorship verification.","limitations","What the source actually contains","Complete game project: main.go contains rendering, match rules, input, game states, audio, and scores; assets/ is committed. Includes go.mod, server/main.go, public/index.html, wasm_exec.js, Dockerfile, and publisher gameplay screenshots. Native run: go run .; the case guide also records the browser build and asset-copy steps.","codeScope","Code type","Implementation","codeType","links","Evidence","items",[79],"evidenceUrl",{"_50":75,"_25":80},"https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/devrel-demos/blob/main/codelabs/gemini-cli/gemini-cli-match3-golang/README.md","Code / instructions",[84],"codeUrl",{"_50":81,"_25":85},"https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/devrel-demos/tree/main/codelabs/gemini-cli/gemini-cli-match3-golang","Primary source",[89],"sourceUrl",{"_50":86,"_25":90},"https://codelabs.developers.google.com/next26/gemini-cli-match3-golang","Engine / runtime","Ebitengine 2 · Go · WebAssembly","engine","list","Attributed clients / models","ordered",false,[100],"agents","Gemini CLI","Toolkit category","Runnable game code","lead","summary","code-example",[109],true,"implementation","gemini-cli",{"_111":112},"documents",{"_113":114,"_115":116},"en",[118,122,123,124,121,125,126,127,128,129,130,131,132,133,134,135,136,137,138,139,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,120,157,119,158,159,160,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178],"zh",[117,118,119,120,121],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-